{
  "Combat.Kelt.DayDreamKelly.FlaringHisNostrils": "Flaring 'his' nostrils, Kelt inhales deeply, his eyelids fluttering closed as he gives a rather lady-like moan. His hands roam over his stiff nipples, tweaking them slightly before he recovers."
  "Combat.Kelt.DayDreamKelly.KeltPausesMid": "Kelt pauses mid-draw, looking you up and down. He licks his lips for a few moments before shaking his head to rouse himself from his lusty stupor. He must miss the taste of your sperm."
  "Combat.Kelt.KellyuraAttack.GrinningKeltRuns": "Grinning, Kelt runs by, trailing a cloud of his musk and pheromones behind you. You have to admit, they get you a little hot under the collar..."
  "Combat.Kelt.KellyuraAttack.KeltFlashesHis": "Kelt flashes his cockiest smile and gestures downward. [say: Did you forget why you're here, slut? Taking me by surprise once doesn't make you any less of a whore.]"
  "Combat.Kelt.KellyuraAttack.KeltSnarls": "Kelt snarls, [say: Why don't you just masturbate like the slut that you are until I come over there and punish you?] "
  "Combat.Kelt.KellyuraAttack.YourHandMoves": "Your hand moves towards your groin seemingly of its own volition."
  "Combat.Kelt.KellyuraAttack.YourHandsTwitch": "Your hands twitch towards your groin but you arrest them. Still, the idea seems to buzz at the back of your brain, exciting you."
  "Combat.Kelt.KeltShootBow.KeltKnocksAnd": "Kelt knocks and fires an arrow almost faster than you can track. He's lost none of his talent with a bow, even after everything you've put him through. "
  "Combat.Kelt.KeltShootBow.TheArrowBites": "The arrow bites into you before you can react."
  "Combat.Kelt.KeltShootBow.YouDeflectThe": "You deflect the hit, preventing it from damaging you."
  "Combat.Kelt.KeltShootBow.YouManageTo": "You manage to avoid the missile by the skin of your teeth!"
  "Combat.Kelt.KeltTramplesJoo.BeforeYouKnow": "Before you know what's what, Kelt is galloping toward you, kicking up a cloud of dust in his wake. He's trying to trample you! "
  "Combat.Kelt.KeltTramplesJoo.IncrediblyYouBrace": "Incredibly, you brace yourself and dig in your [feet]. Kelt slams into you, but you grind his momentum to a half. His mouth flaps uncomprehendingly for a moment before he backs up, flushing from being so close to you."
  "Combat.Kelt.KeltTramplesJoo.YouCanT": "You can't get out of the way in time, and you're knocked down! Kelt tramples overtop of you!"
  "Combat.Kelt.KeltTramplesJoo.YouRollOut": "You roll out of the way at the last moment, avoiding his dangerous hooves."
  "Combat.Kelt.Won.KeltRecoilsFor": "[pg]Kelt recoils for a moment before assuming a look of superiority..."
}
